29
00:00:46,682 --> 00:00:47,822
It started the

30
00:00:47,822 --> 00:00:49,042
summer I
turned nineteen

31
00:00:49,042 --> 00:00:51,362
on a stretch of lake

32
00:00:51,362 --> 00:00:52,202
nobody
remembers the

33
00:00:52,202 --> 00:00:53,412
